# Monitoring Scrape And Alerts

- `victoriametrics/scrape.yml` scrapes only the monitoring host node_exporter.
- Application targets are discovered in `agent/scrape.yml` from Docker labels.
- Generic alerts live in `vmalert/rules/alerts.yml`.
- Product alerts live in `packs/<project>/alerts.yml` and must filter on `project`.
- Alertmanager only routes fired alerts.
- Use labels `project`, `env`, `job`, and `server`. Do not add a global `environment: production` label.
- Host queries must group by `server`, not by `instance`: every agent scrapes `node-exporter:9100`.
- Add `for:`, `summary`, and `description`.
- Keep SMTP values as template placeholders.
